      "type": "text",
      "content": "Here are the standard API prices for both models, in USD per million tokens, based on the snapshot date **2026-10-09**:\n\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "**GPT-6.1 Sol** (Model ID: `gpt-6.1-sol`)\n*   **Input:** $2.00\n*   **Cached Input:** $0.10\n*   **Cache Writes:** $2.50\n*   **Output:** $10.00\n*   *Source:* `openai-sol-61-brief`\n\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "**GPT-6 Astra 6.0** (Model ID: `gpt-6-astra`)\n*   **Input:** $10.00\n*   **Cached Input:** $1.00\n*   **Cache Writes:** $12.50\n*   **Output:** $50.00\n*   *Source:* `openai-astra-6-brief`\n\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "A word of caution: these are standard rates. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "If you push input tokens above 272,000 in a single request, the input and cache rates double, and output costs jump by 50%. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Also, remember that API costs are separate from any ChatGPT subscription allowances; paying for one doesn't buy you the other."
    },
